msgstr "Gekozen item _plakken"

#: src/deskence/ui/clipboard-page.ui:26
msgid ""
"Pastes into the window you were in, with Ctrl+V (Ctrl+Shift+V in terminals). "
"When off, the item is only put on the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Plakt in het venster waarin u was, met Ctrl+V (Ctrl+Shift+V in terminals). "
"Indien uit, wordt het item alleen op het klembord gezet."

